Hi there,

Thank you for getting in touch with the National Heritage Board. We=92ll do=
 our best to get back to you as soon as we can. In the meantime, if your qu=
ery is about:

1.     The National Flag, National Anthem, Coat of Arms, National Pledge, L=
ion Head Symbol, or National Flower,
Please refer to our website<http://www.nhb.gov.sg/what-we-do/our-work/commu=
nity-engagement/education/resources/national-symbols> to find out more abou=
t our National Symbols, and the guidelines for their use. You can click her=
e<https://www.nhb.gov.sg/national-symbol-form> to seek approval for the use=
 of our National Flag and Coat of Arms through the online form.

2.   Heritage Trails
Please refer to our heritage portal, roots.sg/trails<https://roots.sg/trail=
s>, to find out more about our heritage trails and to download trail bookle=
ts. Our community heritage trails are meant to be self-guided with the book=
lets and information from roots.sg<http://roots.sg/>.
3.    Heritage Grants
To find out more about our different grant schemes and to apply for a grant=
, please click here<https://www.nhb.gov.sg/what-we-do/our-work/community-en=
gagement/grants/grants>.

4.    Photos and the National Collection
Please visit our heritage portal, roots.sg/learn/collections<https://roots.=
sg/learn/collections>, to search for images and artefacts from our National=
 Collection. To seek approval to use images that belong to the National Mus=
eum, please go to: https://go.gov.sg/nmsimagerequest. To seek approval to u=
se images that belong to the Asian Civilisations Museum, please go to https=
://go.gov.sg/acmtpm-image-request.
5.    School Museum Visits and Educational Programmes
To organise school visits to our museums and find out more about our educat=
ion programmes, please visit the websites of the Asian Civilisations Museum=
<https://www.acm.org.sg/content/school-visit>, National Museum<https://www.=
nationalmuseum.sg/visitor-information/nmsquicklinkretailvenuerental/group-v=
isits>, Indian Heritage Centre<https://www.indianheritage.org.sg/en/educati=
on/school-visits>, Malay Heritage Centre<https://www.malayheritage.org.sg/e=
n/education/school-visits> and Sun Yat Sun Nanyang Memorial Hall<https://ww=
w.sysnmh.org.sg/en/education/school-visits>.

6.    Corporate and other Group Museum Visits
To organise corporate or other group visits to our museums, please visit th=
e websites of the Asian Civilisations Museum<https://www.acm.org.sg/content=
/group-visit-form>, National Museum<https://www.nationalmuseum.sg/visitor-i=
nformation/nmsquicklinkretailvenuerental/group-visits>, Indian Heritage Cen=
tre<https://www.indianheritage.org.sg/en/visit/booking>, Malay Heritage Cen=
tre<https://www.malayheritage.org.sg/en/visit/tours/corporate-tour> and Sun=
 Yat Sun Nanyang Memorial Hall<https://www.sysnmh.org.sg/en/visit/free-guid=
ed-tours>.
7.    National Monument Walking Tours
To find out more about our National Monument Walking Tours, please click he=
re<https://www.nhb.gov.sg/what-we-do/our-work/preserve-our-stories-treasure=
s-and-places/national-monuments-and-marked-historic-sites/preservation-of-s=
ites-and-monuments/participate/tours>.
8.    Careers and Internships
Visit our website<https://www.nhb.gov.sg/who-we-are/join-us> to find out ab=
out joining NHB. For internship applications, please email nhb_internship@n=
hb.gov.sg<mailto:nhb_internship@nhb.gov.sg>.

If your query is about something else, someone from our team will send you =
a reply within three working days.

Regards,
NHB Feedback




